{"id":12403,"artist":"Chris de Burgh","title":"Forever more","lyrics_plain":"There's an angel cryin' up in Heaven tonight\nAnd I've got the devil in my heart\nBecause I keep on saying things that I don't mean\nAnd it's tearing us apart\nThere's a wild wind blowing in the desert tonight\nOh, how I long to feel the rain\nAnd let it wash away these lonely tears\nAnd bring us back again\n'Cause it's a different world when I look into your eyes\nYou're the nearest thing that I have seen to Paradise\nAnd I know with you I will be in love forever\nThere's a stranger waiting deep in every heart\nTo say the crazy things we say\nBut I promise you he won't be back\nTo steal your dreams away\nSo come up close and put your sweet hand in mine\nI'm going to hold you all night long\nAnd if you wake up I will be here\nTo tell you that I love you\n'Cause it's a different world when I look into your eyes\nYou're the nearest thing that I have seen to Paradise\nAnd I know with you I will be in love forever\n(Instrumental)\nYes, it's a different world when I look into your eyes\nYou're the nearest thing that I have seen to Paradise\nAnd I know with you I will be in love forever\nYes, I know with you I will be in love forever\nIn love forever","lyrics_synced":"[00:01.71] I wake with the dawn, something is wrong,\n[00:08.14] Then I hear you breathing softly by my side,\n[00:15.00] And I know that I was dreaming\n[00:17.57] Of a time that may come\n[00:21.86] When you would be no longer in my life.\n[00:29.14] I slip out of bed, I go downstairs,\n[00:35.57] Still troubled by the power of the dream,\n[00:42.43] And I know that I don't say it quite as much as I should\n[00:49.29] The way I feel and what you mean to me.\n[00:55.29] You are my lover, you are my friend,\n[01:02.14] You are my life to the very end.\n[01:09.00] You bring me comfort, you keep me warm,\n[01:15.86] You give me hope, you make me strong,\n[01:22.71] You take me away to a distant shore\n[01:29.57] And it's with you that I want to stay forever more.\n[01:44.57] You go out at night, you're looking so good,\n[01:51.00] People turning as you walk into the room,\n[01:57.86] When I stand beside you\n[01:59.79] I can feel the pride in my heart\n[02:04.71] To know that you are here with me tonight.\n[02:12.00] You are my lover, you are my friend,\n[02:18.43] you are my life to the very end.\n[02:25.29] You bring me comfort, keep me warm,\n[02:27.86] You give me hope, you make me strong,\n[02:32.14] You take me away to a distant shore\n[02:38.14] And it's with you\n[02:41.57] And it's with you that I'm going to stay forever more.\n[02:51.86] Yes, it's with you that I'm going to stay forever more.\n[03:02.14] Forever more\n[03:05.57] Yes, it's with you that I'm going to stay forever more.\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:01.71] <00:01.71>I <00:02.14>wake <00:02.57>with <00:02.99>the <00:03.42>dawn, <00:05.14>some <00:05.57>thing <00:05.99>is <00:06.42>wrong,\n[00:08.14] <00:08.14>Then <00:08.35>I <00:08.57>hear <00:08.99>you <00:09.21>brea <00:09.64>thing <00:10.07>sof <00:10.28>tly <00:11.14>by <00:11.57>my <00:11.99>side,\n[00:14.99] <00:14.99>And <00:15.21>I <00:15.42>know <00:15.85>that <00:16.07>I <00:16.49>was <00:16.92>drea <00:17.14>ming\n[00:17.57] <00:17.57>Of <00:17.99>a <00:18.42>time <00:18.85>that <00:19.28>may <00:19.49>come\n[00:21.85] <00:21.85>When <00:22.28>you <00:22.71>would <00:22.92>be <00:23.57>no <00:23.99>lon <00:24.42>ger <00:24.85>in <00:25.07>my <00:25.71>life.\n[00:29.14] <00:29.14>I <00:29.57>slip <00:29.99>out <00:30.42>of <00:30.85>bed, <00:32.14>I <00:32.57>go <00:32.99>down <00:33.42>stairs,\n[00:35.57] <00:35.57>Still <00:35.99>trou <00:36.42>bled <00:36.64>by <00:37.07>the <00:37.49>po <00:38.14>wer <00:38.57>of <00:38.99>the <00:39.42>dream,\n[00:42.42] <00:42.42>And <00:42.64>I <00:42.85>know <00:43.28>that <00:43.49>I <00:43.92>don't <00:44.35>say <00:44.57>it <00:44.99>quite <00:45.42>as <00:45.85>much <00:46.28>as <00:46.71>I <00:46.92>should\n[00:4